<li data-start=3D"3838" data-end=3D"3926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3840" data-end=3D"3926" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
840" data-end=3D"3868">2=C3=A8me Forme Normale (2NF)</strong> : Chaque colo=
nne d=C3=A9pend enti=C3=A8rement de la cl=C3=A9 primaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3927" data-end=3D"4027" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3929" data-end=3D"4027" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
929" data-end=3D"3957">3=C3=A8me Forme Normale (3NF)</strong> : Aucune colo=
nne ne d=C3=A9pend d=E2=80=99un attribut autre que la cl=C3=A9 primaire.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
