<li data-start=3D"8087" data-end=3D"8142" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8089" data-end=3D"8142" class=3D"">Pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rez les =
cl=C3=A9s primaires simples lorsque possible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8143" data-end=3D"8247" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8145" data-end=3D"8247" class=3D"">Les cl=C3=A9s primaires=
 garantissent une int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 des donn=C3=A9es et am=C3=A9liorent l=
es performances des requ=C3=AAtes.</p>
</li>
