" data-end=3D"1368"><code data-start=3D"1352" data-end=3D"1366">departement=
s</code></strong>. Chaque employ=C3=A9 appartient =C3=A0 un d=C3=A9partemen=
t, et chaque d=C3=A9partement a une cl=C3=A9 primaire <strong data-start=3D=
"1455" data-end=3D"1463"><code data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1461">id</co=
de></strong>. La table <strong data-start=3D"1474" data-end=3D"1488"><code =
data-start=3D"1476" data-end=3D"1486">employes</code></strong> contiendra u=
ne cl=C3=A9 =C3=A9trang=C3=A8re <strong data-start=3D"1518" data-end=3D"153=
8"><code data-start=3D"1520" data-end=3D"1536">id_departement</code></stron=
g> qui se r=C3=A9f=C3=A8re =C3=A0 la cl=C3=A9 primaire <strong data-start=
=3D"1571" data-end=3D"1579"><code data-start=3D"1573" data-end=3D"1577">id<=
/code></strong> de la table <strong data-start=3D"1592" data-end=3D"1610"><=
code data-start=3D"1594" data-end=3D"1608">departements</code></strong>.</h=
3>
