3324" data-end=3D"3353">3.2. Pr=C3=A9cision et =C3=89chelle</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3355" data-end=3D"3529">
<li data-start=3D"3355" data-end=3D"3458" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3357" data-end=3D"3458" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
357" data-end=3D"3370">Pr=C3=A9cision</strong> : Le nombre total de chiffre=
s dans le nombre, y compris ceux avant et apr=C3=A8s la virgule.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3459" data-end=3D"3529" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3461" data-end=3D"3529" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
461" data-end=3D"3472">=C3=89chelle</strong> : Le nombre de chiffres =C3=A0=
 droite de la virgule d=C3=A9cimale.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3531" data-end=3D"3659" class=3D"">Par exemple, pour un ty=
pe <strong data-start=3D"3557" data-end=3D"3575"><code data-start=3D"3559" =
data-end=3D"3573">DECIMAL(5,2)</code></strong>, la valeur maximale possible=
 est <strong data-start=3D"3609" data-end=3D"3619">999.99</strong>, et la v=
aleur minimale est <strong data-start=3D"3647" data-end=3D"3658">-999.99</s=
trong>.</p>
