REAL</code></strong> est un type de donn=C3=A9es =C3=A0 virgule flottante a=
vec une pr=C3=A9cision simple. En PostgreSQL, <strong data-start=3D"4851" d=
ata-end=3D"4861"><code data-start=3D"4853" data-end=3D"4859">REAL</code></s=
trong> est une repr=C3=A9sentation approximative d'un nombre r=C3=A9el sur =
4 octets.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5040">
<li data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5040" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4933" data-end=3D"5040" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
933" data-end=3D"4946">Pr=C3=A9cision</strong> : Le type <strong data-start=
