5139" data-end=3D"5164">4.3. DOUBLE PRECISION</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5166" data-end=3D"5345" class=3D"">Le type <strong data-st=
art=3D"5174" data-end=3D"5196"><code data-start=3D"5176" data-end=3D"5194">=
