=3D"5219" data-end=3D"5229"><code data-start=3D"5221" data-end=3D"5227">REA=
L</code></strong>, mais avec une pr=C3=A9cision plus =C3=A9lev=C3=A9e. Il e=
st utilis=C3=A9 pour les calculs n=C3=A9cessitant plus de pr=C3=A9cision qu=
e <strong data-start=3D"5334" data-end=3D"5344"><code data-start=3D"5336" d=
ata-end=3D"5342">REAL</code></strong>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5347" data-end=3D"5474">
<li data-start=3D"5347" data-end=3D"5474" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5349" data-end=3D"5474" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
349" data-end=3D"5362">Pr=C3=A9cision</strong> : Le type <strong data-start=
