<h3 data-start=3D"5946" data-end=3D"5992" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5950" data-end=3D"5992">5.1. Concat=C3=A9nation de Cha=C3=AEnes de Texte</s=
trong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5994" data-end=3D"6086" class=3D"">PostgreSQL vous permet =
de concat=C3=A9ner des cha=C3=AEnes de caract=C3=A8res =C3=A0 l'aide de l'o=
p=C3=A9rateur <code data-start=3D"6081" data-end=3D"6085">||</code>.</p>
