<h3 data-start=3D"2724" data-end=3D"2764" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2728" data-end=3D"2764">3.1. Qu'est-ce que <code data-start=3D"2749" data-e=
nd=3D"2760">TIMESTAMP</code> ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2766" data-end=3D"3012" class=3D"">Le type <strong data-st=
art=3D"2774" data-end=3D"2789"><code data-start=3D"2776" data-end=3D"2787">=
TIMESTAMP</code></strong> permet de stocker une date et une heure, incluant=
 l'ann=C3=A9e, le mois, le jour, l'heure, la minute, la seconde et parfois =
les fractions de seconde. <strong data-start=3D"2935" data-end=3D"2950"><co=
de data-start=3D"2937" data-end=3D"2948">TIMESTAMP</code></strong> peut =C3=
=AAtre utilis=C3=A9 avec ou sans information de fuseau horaire.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3014" data-end=3D"3189">
<li data-start=3D"3014" data-end=3D"3105" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3016" data-end=3D"3105" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
016" data-end=3D"3049"><code data-start=3D"3018" data-end=3D"3047">TIMESTAM=
P WITHOUT TIME ZONE</code></strong> : Ne contient pas d'informations sur le=
 fuseau horaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3106" data-end=3D"3189" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3108" data-end=3D"3189" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
108" data-end=3D"3138"><code data-start=3D"3110" data-end=3D"3136">TIMESTAM=
P WITH TIME ZONE</code></strong> : Contient des informations sur le fuseau =
horaire.</p>
</li>
</ul>
