<h4 data-start=3D"5131" data-end=3D"5153" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5136" data-end=3D"5151">Explication</strong> :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5154" data-end=3D"5432">
<li data-start=3D"5154" data-end=3D"5283" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5157" data-end=3D"5283" class=3D"">La sous-requ=C3=AAte da=
ns la clause <strong data-start=3D"5188" data-end=3D"5196">FROM</strong> (a=
lias=C3=A9e comme <code data-start=3D"5212" data-end=3D"5231">commandes_tot=
ales</code>) calcule le total des commandes pour chaque client.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5284" data-end=3D"5432" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5287" data-end=3D"5432" class=3D"">Ensuite, cette sous-req=
u=C3=AAte est jointe =C3=A0 la table <strong data-start=3D"5337" data-end=
=3D"5348">clients</strong> en fonction de la colonne <code data-start=3D"53=
75" data-end=3D"5379">id</code> de <strong data-start=3D"5383" data-end=3D"=
5394">clients</strong> et de <code data-start=3D"5401" data-end=3D"5412">cl=
ient_id</code> de la sous-requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"5434" data-end=3D"5453" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5439" data-end=3D"5451">R=C3=A9sultat</strong> :</h4>
