<h4 data-start=3D"6783" data-end=3D"6805" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6788" data-end=3D"6803">Explication</strong> :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"6806" data-end=3D"7156">
<li data-start=3D"6806" data-end=3D"6891" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6809" data-end=3D"6891" class=3D"">La sous-requ=C3=AAte co=
rr=C3=A9l=C3=A9e fait r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"6851" =
data-end=3D"6863">clients.id</code> dans la requ=C3=AAte principale.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6892" data-end=3D"6991" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6895" data-end=3D"6991" class=3D"">La condition <code data=
-start=3D"6908" data-end=3D"6943">commandes.client_id !=3D clients.id</code=
> s'assure que la commande est d'un autre client.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6992" data-end=3D"7156" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6995" data-end=3D"7156" class=3D"">La sous-requ=C3=AAte in=
terne (<code data-start=3D"7020" data-end=3D"7090">SELECT montant FROM comm=
andes WHERE commandes.client_id =3D clients.id</code>) r=C3=A9cup=C3=A8re l=
es montants des commandes du client en cours d'examen.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"7158" data-end=3D"7177" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7163" data-end=3D"7175">R=C3=A9sultat</strong> :</h4>
<div class=3D"overflow-x-auto contain-inline-size"><table data-start=3D"717=
8" data-end=3D"7216" node=3D"[object Object]"><thead data-start=3D"7178" da=
ta-end=3D"7190"><tr data-start=3D"7178" data-end=3D"7190"><th data-start=3D=
"7178" data-end=3D"7190">nom</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=3D"7204" da=
ta-end=3D"7216"><tr data-start=3D"7204" data-end=3D"7216"><td>Alice</td></t=
r></tbody></table></div>
<p data-start=3D"7218" data-end=3D"7358" class=3D"">Dans cet exemple, la re=
qu=C3=AAte retourne les clients qui ont effectu=C3=A9 une commande sup=C3=
=A9rieure =C3=A0 la commande la plus co=C3=BBteuse d'un autre client.</p>
