<li data-start=3D"1355" data-end=3D"1413" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1358" data-end=3D"1413" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
358" data-end=3D"1365">MAX</strong> : Retourne la plus grande valeur d'une =
colonne.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"1415" data-end=3D"1622" class=3D"">Dans ce tutoriel, nous =
nous concentrerons sur <strong data-start=3D"1461" data-end=3D"1468">SUM</s=
