<h3 data-start=3D"8451" data-end=3D"8478" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8455" data-end=3D"8478">6.2. Index Partiels</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8480" data-end=3D"8754" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"8483" data-end=3D"8500">index partiel</strong> est un index qui ne couv=
