n de cet index acc=C3=A9l=C3=A9rera les requ=C3=AAtes impliquant la colonne=
 <code data-start=3D"4965" data-end=3D"4972">email</code>.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4975" data-end=3D"5015" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4979" data-end=3D"5015">3.2. Utiliser des Index Compos=C3=A9s</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5017" data-end=3D"5249" class=3D"">Si vous effectuez souve=
