ieurs options lors de la cr=C3=A9ation, comme :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2603" data-end=3D"2920">
<li data-start=3D"2603" data-end=3D"2670" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2605" data-end=3D"2670" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"260=
5" data-end=3D"2615">CREATEDB</code>: permet =C3=A0 l'utilisateur de cr=C3=
=A9er des bases de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2671" data-end=3D"2729" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2673" data-end=3D"2729" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"267=
3" data-end=3D"2685">CREATEROLE</code>: permet =C3=A0 l'utilisateur de cr=
=C3=A9er des r=C3=B4les.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2730" data-end=3D"2843" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2732" data-end=3D"2843" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"273=
2" data-end=3D"2743">SUPERUSER</code>: donne =C3=A0 l'utilisateur tous les =
privil=C3=A8ges dans PostgreSQL (attention, =C3=A0 utiliser avec pr=C3=A9ca=
ution).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2844" data-end=3D"2920" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2846" data-end=3D"2920" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"284=
6" data-end=3D"2855">INHERIT</code>: permet =C3=A0 l'utilisateur d'h=C3=A9r=
iter des privil=C3=A8ges d'autres r=C3=B4les.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2922" data-end=3D"2925" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2927" data-end=3D"2989" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2930" data-end=3D"2989">3. Attribution de r=C3=B4les et permissions aux uti=
