3471" data-end=3D"3516">3.2. Accorder des permissions sp=C3=A9cifiques</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3518" data-end=3D"3664" class=3D"">Pour accorder des permi=
ssions sur des objets de base de donn=C3=A9es comme les tables, vues, ou sc=
h=C3=A9mas, vous pouvez utiliser les commandes suivantes :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3868">
<li data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3706" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3667" data-end=3D"3706" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
667" data-end=3D"3677">SELECT</strong>: Permet de lire les donn=C3=A9es.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3707" data-end=3D"3759" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3709" data-end=3D"3759" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
709" data-end=3D"3719">INSERT</strong>: Permet d'ins=C3=A9rer de nouvelles =
donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3760" data-end=3D"3821" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3762" data-end=3D"3821" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
762" data-end=3D"3772">UPDATE</strong>: Permet de mettre =C3=A0 jour des do=
nn=C3=A9es existantes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3822" data-end=3D"3868" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3824" data-end=3D"3868" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
824" data-end=3D"3834">DELETE</strong>: Permet de supprimer des donn=C3=A9e=
s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
