<li data-start=3D"2811" data-end=3D"2881" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2813" data-end=3D"2881" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
813" data-end=3D"2825">CREATEDB</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99utilisat=
eur de cr=C3=A9er des bases de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2882" data-end=3D"2943" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2884" data-end=3D"2943" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
884" data-end=3D"2898">CREATEROLE</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99utilis=
ateur de cr=C3=A9er des r=C3=B4les.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2944" data-end=3D"3055" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2946" data-end=3D"3055" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
946" data-end=3D"2959">SUPERUSER</strong> : Donne tous les privil=C3=A8ges =
de la base de donn=C3=A9es, y compris l=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s complet =C3=A0 t=
ous les objets.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3056" data-end=3D"3153" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3058" data-end=3D"3153" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
058" data-end=3D"3069">INHERIT</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99utilisate=
ur d=E2=80=99h=C3=A9riter des privil=C3=A8ges des r=C3=B4les auxquels il ap=
partient.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3155" data-end=3D"3158" class=3D"">
