der des permissions sur ces objets :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3526" data-end=3D"3596">
<li data-start=3D"3526" data-end=3D"3596" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3528" data-end=3D"3596" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
528" data-end=3D"3539">EXECUTE</strong> : Permet d'ex=C3=A9cuter la fonctio=
