<h3 data-start=3D"7303" data-end=3D"7362" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7307" data-end=3D"7362">5.2. Consulter les Permissions via les Vues Syst=C3=
=A8me</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7364" data-end=3D"7595" class=3D"">PostgreSQL met =C3=A0 d=
