<h3 data-start=3D"4010" data-end=3D"4072" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4014" data-end=3D"4072">2.3. Gestion des Pannes dans la R=C3=A9plication As=
ynchrone</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4074" data-end=3D"4370" class=3D"">En cas de panne du serv=
eur ma=C3=AEtre, le serveur esclave peut devenir le nouveau ma=C3=AEtre =C3=
=A0 l=E2=80=99aide d=E2=80=99un <strong data-start=3D"4173" data-end=3D"418=
4">promote</strong> manuel. Si la r=C3=A9plication est configur=C3=A9e corr=
ectement, le serveur esclave contient d=C3=A9j=C3=A0 une copie compl=C3=A8t=
e de la base de donn=C3=A9es et peut donc =C3=AAtre promu en ma=C3=AEtre sa=
ns perte de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4372" data-end=3D"4375" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4377" data-end=3D"4427" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4380" data-end=3D"4427">3. R=C3=A9plication Synchronis=C3=A9e dans PostgreS=
QL</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4429" data-end=3D"4481" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4433" data-end=3D"4481">3.1. Principe de la R=C3=A9plication Synchronis=C3=
=A9e</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4483" data-end=3D"4838" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"4486" data-end=3D"4514">r=C3=A9plication synchronis=C3=A9e</strong> ass=
ure qu=E2=80=99une transaction est valid=C3=A9e sur le serveur ma=C3=AEtre =
uniquement lorsque les r=C3=A9pliques ont confirm=C3=A9 qu=E2=80=99elles on=
t bien re=C3=A7u les modifications. Cela garantit une <strong data-start=3D=
"4681" data-end=3D"4700">coh=C3=A9rence forte</strong> entre le ma=C3=AEtre=
 et les esclaves, mais cela peut entra=C3=AEner une latence accrue, car le =
serveur ma=C3=AEtre attend la confirmation des r=C3=A9pliques.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4840" data-end=3D"5382">
<li data-start=3D"4840" data-end=3D"5161" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4842" data-end=3D"4857" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
842" data-end=3D"4855">Avantages</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4860" data-end=3D"5161">
<li data-start=3D"4860" data-end=3D"4978" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4862" data-end=3D"4978" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
862" data-end=3D"4881">Coh=C3=A9rence forte</strong> : Les donn=C3=A9es son=
t garanties d'=C3=AAtre synchronis=C3=A9es entre le ma=C3=AEtre et les escl=
aves =C3=A0 tout moment.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4981" data-end=3D"5057" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4983" data-end=3D"5057" class=3D"">Moins de risque de <str=
ong data-start=3D"5002" data-end=3D"5022">perte de donn=C3=A9es</strong> en=
 cas de panne du serveur ma=C3=AEtre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5060" data-end=3D"5161" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5062" data-end=3D"5161" class=3D"">Id=C3=A9al pour les app=
lications n=C3=A9cessitant une haute coh=C3=A9rence et une forte disponibil=
it=C3=A9 des donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5163" data-end=3D"5382" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5165" data-end=3D"5184" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
165" data-end=3D"5182">Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5187" data-end=3D"5382">
<li data-start=3D"5187" data-end=3D"5304" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5189" data-end=3D"5304" class=3D"">La latence accrue peut =
ralentir les transactions, car le serveur ma=C3=AEtre doit attendre la conf=
irmation des esclaves.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5307" data-end=3D"5382" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5309" data-end=3D"5382" class=3D"">N=C3=A9cessite une infr=
astructure de serveurs plus robuste et bien configur=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5384" data-end=3D"5441" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5388" data-end=3D"5441">3.2. Configuration de la R=C3=A9plication Synchroni=
s=C3=A9e</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5443" data-end=3D"5693" class=3D"">La configuration de la =
r=C3=A9plication synchronis=C3=A9e dans PostgreSQL n=C3=A9cessite de sp=C3=
=A9cifier les serveurs esclaves avec lesquels le ma=C3=AEtre doit =C3=AAtre=
 synchronis=C3=A9. Le serveur ma=C3=AEtre attendra une confirmation de ces =
esclaves avant de valider les transactions.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"5695" data-end=3D"5725" class=3D"">=C3=89tapes de configu=
ration :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"5727" data-end=3D"6716">
<li data-start=3D"5727" data-end=3D"6236" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5730" data-end=3D"5757" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
730" data-end=3D"5755">Sur le serveur ma=C3=AEtre</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5761" data-end=3D"6236">
<li data-start=3D"5761" data-end=3D"6139" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5763" data-end=3D"5834" class=3D"">Activez la r=C3=A9plica=
tion synchronis=C3=A9e dans le fichier <code data-start=3D"5815" data-end=
=3D"5832">postgresql.conf</code> :</p>
<pre class=3D"!overflow-visible" data-start=3D"5840" data-end=3D"5997"><div=
