on =C3=A0 la base.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3237" data-end=3D"3334" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3239" data-end=3D"3334" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
239" data-end=3D"3261"><code data-start=3D"3241" data-end=3D"3259">-d nouve=
lle_base</code></strong> : Sp=C3=A9cifie la base de donn=C3=A9es cible dans=
 laquelle restaurer les donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3335" data-end=3D"3420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3337" data-end=3D"3420" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
337" data-end=3D"3373"><code data-start=3D"3339" data-end=3D"3371">-f /chem=
in/vers/sauvegarde.sql</code></strong> : Sp=C3=A9cifie le fichier contenant=
