<h2 data-start=3D"7229" data-end=3D"7291" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7232" data-end=3D"7291">7. Sauvegardes dans des Stockages Externes (FTP, Cl=
oud)</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"7293" data-end=3D"7522" class=3D"">Les sauvegardes peuvent=
