<hr data-start=3D"7120" data-end=3D"7123" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7125" data-end=3D"7152" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7128" data-end=3D"7152">6. Gestion des Index</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7154" data-end=3D"7196" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7158" data-end=3D"7196">6.1. Types d'index dans PostgreSQL</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7198" data-end=3D"7278" class=3D"">PostgreSQL propose plus=
ieurs types d'index, chacun ayant ses propres avantages :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7280" data-end=3D"7682">
<li data-start=3D"7280" data-end=3D"7359" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7282" data-end=3D"7359" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
282" data-end=3D"7292">B-tree</strong> (par d=C3=A9faut) : Utilis=C3=A9 pou=
r les comparaisons d'=C3=A9galit=C3=A9 et d'ordre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7360" data-end=3D"7424" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7362" data-end=3D"7424" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
362" data-end=3D"7370">Hash</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour les comparaisons d=
'=C3=A9galit=C3=A9 uniquement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7425" data-end=3D"7526" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7427" data-end=3D"7526" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
427" data-end=3D"7435">GiST</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour des types de donn=
=C3=A9es g=C3=A9om=C3=A9triques ou des index de recherche plus complexes.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7527" data-end=3D"7608" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7529" data-end=3D"7608" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
529" data-end=3D"7536">GIN</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour les types de donn=
=C3=A9es tels que <strong data-start=3D"7582" data-end=3D"7591">jsonb</stro=
ng>, <strong data-start=3D"7593" data-end=3D"7602">array</strong>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7609" data-end=3D"7682" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7611" data-end=3D"7682" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
611" data-end=3D"7622">SP-GiST</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour les structures =
de donn=C3=A9es non hi=C3=A9rarchiques.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7684" data-end=3D"7713" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7688" data-end=3D"7713">6.2. Cr=C3=A9ation d'index</strong></h3>
