<h3 data-start=3D"4611" data-end=3D"4652" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4615" data-end=3D"4652">2.4. Verrou de Table (Table Lock)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4654" data-end=3D"4907" class=3D"">Le verrou de table bloq=
