<li data-start=3D"4895" data-end=3D"4974" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4897" data-end=3D"4974" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
897" data-end=3D"4905"><code data-start=3D"4899" data-end=3D"4903">-&gt;</c=
ode></strong> : Acc=C3=A8de =C3=A0 un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment en renvoyant un obj=
et JSON ou un tableau JSON.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4975" data-end=3D"5039" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4977" data-end=3D"5039" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
977" data-end=3D"4986"><code data-start=3D"4979" data-end=3D"4984">-&gt;&gt=
;</code></strong> : Acc=C3=A8de =C3=A0 un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment en renvoyant un=
e valeur texte.</p>
</li>
</ul>
