<p data-start=3D"2878" data-end=3D"3000" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
878" data-end=3D"2931">Audit des requ=C3=AAtes DDL (Data Definition Languag=
e)</strong> : Cr=C3=A9ation, modification et suppression de tables, index, =
vues, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3001" data-end=3D"3110" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3003" data-end=3D"3110" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
003" data-end=3D"3058">Audit des requ=C3=AAtes DML (Data Manipulation Langu=
age)</strong> : Insertion, mise =C3=A0 jour et suppression de donn=C3=A9es.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3111" data-end=3D"3219" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3113" data-end=3D"3219" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
113" data-end=3D"3153">Audit des connexions et d=C3=A9connexions</strong> :=
 Suivi des connexions r=C3=A9ussies et =C3=A9chou=C3=A9es =C3=A0 la base de=
 donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3220" data-end=3D"3334" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3222" data-end=3D"3334" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
222" data-end=3D"3260">Audit des privil=C3=A8ges d'utilisateur</strong> : S=
urveillance des actions d'attribution et de r=C3=A9vocation des privil=C3=
=A8ges.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3336" data-end=3D"3545" class=3D"">En r=C3=A9sum=C3=A9, pg=
Audit permet de g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer des logs complets des activit=C3=A9s SQL =
ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9es sur la base de donn=C3=A9es, ce qui aide =C3=A0 d=C3=A9=
tecter les comportements suspects et =C3=A0 am=C3=A9liorer la s=C3=A9curit=
=C3=A9 globale de votre syst=C3=A8me.</p>
