<h3 data-start=3D"4578" data-end=3D"4614" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4582" data-end=3D"4614">2.2 Installation sur Windows</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4616" data-end=3D"4876" class=3D"">Sur Windows, l=E2=80=99=
installation se fait =C3=A9galement via l=E2=80=99installateur de PostgreSQ=
