<p data-start=3D"5709" data-end=3D"5756" class=3D"">Les valeurs possibles p=
our <code data-start=3D"5736" data-end=3D"5749">pgaudit.log</code> sont :</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"5758" data-end=3D"6187">
<li data-start=3D"5758" data-end=3D"5825" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5760" data-end=3D"5825" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
760" data-end=3D"5768">read</strong> : Audit des requ=C3=AAtes de lecture (=
par exemple, <code data-start=3D"5815" data-end=3D"5823">SELECT</code>).</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5826" data-end=3D"5914" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5828" data-end=3D"5914" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
828" data-end=3D"5837">write</strong> : Audit des requ=C3=AAtes d'=C3=A9cri=
ture (par exemple, <code data-start=3D"5884" data-end=3D"5892">INSERT</code=
>, <code data-start=3D"5894" data-end=3D"5902">UPDATE</code>, <code data-st=
art=3D"5904" data-end=3D"5912">DELETE</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5915" data-end=3D"5961" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5917" data-end=3D"5961" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
917" data-end=3D"5929">function</strong> : Audit des appels de fonction.</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5962" data-end=3D"6038" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5964" data-end=3D"6038" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
964" data-end=3D"5971">ddl</strong> : Audit des requ=C3=AAtes DDL (par exem=
ple, <code data-start=3D"6011" data-end=3D"6019">CREATE</code>, <code data-=
start=3D"6021" data-end=3D"6027">DROP</code>, <code data-start=3D"6029" dat=
a-end=3D"6036">ALTER</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6039" data-end=3D"6103" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6041" data-end=3D"6103" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
041" data-end=3D"6049">role</strong> : Audit des modifications de r=C3=B4le=
s et de permissions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6104" data-end=3D"6187" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6106" data-end=3D"6187" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
106" data-end=3D"6114">misc</strong> : Audit des autres actions non couvert=
es par les cat=C3=A9gories pr=C3=A9c=C3=A9dentes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6189" data-end=3D"6192" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6194" data-end=3D"6256" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6197" data-end=3D"6256">4. Utilisation de pgAudit pour l'audit des requ=C3=
=AAtes SQL</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6258" data-end=3D"6299" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
