<h3 data-start=3D"8487" data-end=3D"8527" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8491" data-end=3D"8527">4.2 S=C3=A9curisation des sauvegardes</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8529" data-end=3D"8623" class=3D"">Les sauvegardes doivent=
 =C3=A9galement =C3=AAtre s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9es, =C3=A0 la fois en termes d=
=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s et de stockage.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8625" data-end=3D"8799">
