<h2 data-start=3D"2808" data-end=3D"2865" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2811" data-end=3D"2865">1. Introduction aux services cloud pour PostgreSQL<=
/strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2867" data-end=3D"3253" class=3D"">Le d=C3=A9ploiement de =
PostgreSQL dans un environnement cloud offre de nombreux avantages : =C3=A9=
volutivit=C3=A9, haute disponibilit=C3=A9, r=C3=A9duction des co=C3=BBts de=
 gestion, et gestion simplifi=C3=A9e des ressources. Chaque fournisseur de =
cloud (AWS, GCP, Azure) offre des services g=C3=A9r=C3=A9s pour PostgreSQL,=
 mais il est aussi possible de d=C3=A9ployer PostgreSQL de mani=C3=A8re aut=
onome en utilisant des machines virtuelles.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3255" data-end=3D"3332" class=3D"">Les services g=C3=A9r=
=C3=A9s dans chaque cloud offrent une s=C3=A9rie d=E2=80=99avantages tels q=
ue :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3333" data-end=3D"3492">
<li data-start=3D"3333" data-end=3D"3363" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3335" data-end=3D"3363" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
335" data-end=3D"3362">Mise =C3=A0 jour automatique</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3364" data-end=3D"3393" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3366" data-end=3D"3393" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
366" data-end=3D"3392">Sauvegarde automatique</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3394" data-end=3D"3451" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3396" data-end=3D"3451" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
396" data-end=3D"3419">Haute disponibilit=C3=A9</strong> et <strong data-st=
art=3D"3423" data-end=3D"3450">scalabilit=C3=A9 horizontale</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3452" data-end=3D"3492" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3454" data-end=3D"3492" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
454" data-end=3D"3476">Gestion simplifi=C3=A9e</strong> des ressources.</p>
</li>
</ul>
