<h2 data-start=3D"3499" data-end=3D"3542" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3502" data-end=3D"3542">2. D=C3=A9ploiement de PostgreSQL sur AWS</strong><=
/h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3544" data-end=3D"3590" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3548" data-end=3D"3590">2.1 Utilisation de RDS pour PostgreSQL</strong></h3=
>
<p data-start=3D"3592" data-end=3D"3797" class=3D"">Amazon RDS (Relational =
Database Service) est un service manag=C3=A9 qui facilite la configuration,=
 l'exploitation et la mise =C3=A0 l'=C3=A9chelle des bases de donn=C3=A9es =
relationnelles dans le cloud, y compris PostgreSQL.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3799" data-end=3D"3827" class=3D"">=C3=89tapes de d=C3=A9=
ploiement :</h4>
<ol data-start=3D"3828" data-end=3D"5009">
<li data-start=3D"3828" data-end=3D"4352" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3831" data-end=3D"3859" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
831" data-end=3D"3857">Cr=C3=A9er une instance RDS</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3863" data-end=3D"4352">
<li data-start=3D"3863" data-end=3D"3905" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3865" data-end=3D"3905" class=3D"">Connectez-vous =C3=A0 A=
WS Management Console.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3909" data-end=3D"3985" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3911" data-end=3D"3985" class=3D"">Allez dans le service <=
strong data-start=3D"3933" data-end=3D"3940">RDS</strong> et choisissez <st=
rong data-start=3D"3955" data-end=3D"3984">Cr=C3=A9er une base de donn=C3=
=A9es</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3989" data-end=3D"4051" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3991" data-end=3D"4051" class=3D"">S=C3=A9lectionnez <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4004" data-end=3D"4018">PostgreSQL</strong> comme moteur d=
e base de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4055" data-end=3D"4169" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4057" data-end=3D"4169" class=3D"">Choisissez un mod=C3=A8=
le de d=C3=A9ploiement (par exemple, <strong data-start=3D"4107" data-end=
=3D"4121">Production</strong> pour une configuration de haute disponibilit=
=C3=A9).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4173" data-end=3D"4274" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4175" data-end=3D"4274" class=3D"">Configurez les param=C3=
=A8tres de l'instance (nom, type de machine virtuelle, taille du stockage, =
etc.).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4278" data-end=3D"4348" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4280" data-end=3D"4348" class=3D"">Configurez les options =
de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 (groupes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, VPC, etc.).</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4353" data-end=3D"4588" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4356" data-end=3D"4388" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
356" data-end=3D"4386">Acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 la base de donn=C3=A9es</strong> :=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4392" data-end=3D"4588">
<li data-start=3D"4392" data-end=3D"4499" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4394" data-end=3D"4499" class=3D"">Assurez-vous d'avoir co=
nfigur=C3=A9 le groupe de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 pour permettre l'acc=C3=A8s =
=C3=A0 partir de vos applications.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4503" data-end=3D"4588" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4505" data-end=3D"4588" class=3D"">R=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rez l'a=
dresse endpoint et connectez-vous avec <code data-start=3D"4557" data-end=
=3D"4563">psql</code> ou un client compatible.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4590" data-end=3D"4859" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4593" data-end=3D"4618" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
593" data-end=3D"4616">Haute disponibilit=C3=A9</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4622" data-end=3D"4859">
<li data-start=3D"4622" data-end=3D"4725" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4624" data-end=3D"4725" class=3D"">RDS permet la cr=C3=A9a=
tion d'instances Multi-AZ pour la haute disponibilit=C3=A9 et la reprise ap=
r=C3=A8s sinistre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4729" data-end=3D"4859" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4731" data-end=3D"4859" class=3D"">Choisissez l'option <st=
rong data-start=3D"4751" data-end=3D"4763">Multi-AZ</strong> lors de la con=
figuration pour avoir une r=C3=A9plique synchrone sur une autre zone de dis=
ponibilit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4861" data-end=3D"5009" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4864" data-end=3D"4881" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
864" data-end=3D"4879">Scalabilit=C3=A9</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4885" data-end=3D"5009">
<li data-start=3D"4885" data-end=3D"5009" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4887" data-end=3D"5009" class=3D"">Vous pouvez modifier fa=
cilement la taille de l'instance ou ajuster le stockage en fonction des bes=
oins via la console AWS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5011" data-end=3D"5049" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5015" data-end=3D"5049">2.2 D=C3=A9ploiement manuel sur EC2</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5051" data-end=3D"5223" class=3D"">Si vous pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9=
rez g=C3=A9rer votre propre instance PostgreSQL sur AWS, vous pouvez lancer=
